A radial eight‑nozzle spray bar assembly, fabricated from Ti‑6Al‑4V tubing of 6 mm inner diameter and total circuit length 14 m, with stainless‑steel valve bodies and PTFE seat seals, is estimated at 8 kg total. This mass is added to the system budget as a line item between the helium circulation loops and the radiator.

